      "type": "text",
      "title": "What a rank does",
      "text": [
        "- Rank 1: **85%** of the time, **118%** of the Pulse a second.",
        "- Rank 2: **70%** of the time, **143%** of the Pulse.",
        "- Rank 3: **55%** of the time, **182%** of the Pulse.",
        "Pulse per craft stays about even: the extra speed is paid on the lattice.",
        "Generators work differently: each rank adds **15% Pulse a second**, not the workshop 118%. Relays move more and pay more Pulse for the extra cargo. Camp hands beat faster at the same Pulse per move."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Which machines",
      "text": [
        "Every Echo station, the Ember Kiln and the Song Bench; the Drumheart, Ley Collector, Pulse Resonator and all five voice-crafts; the Lattice Conductor, Pulse Adapter, Ancestral Cache and Spirit Cistern; every relay; the Stone Font and Resonance Mesh; and the camp hands (Tide Pump, Wind Snare, Ward Drum, Seal Loom).",
        "The tooltip names the rank. If a station will not take the machine, it is the wrong station for its current rank; crouch and right-click the station with this book."
